---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /index.html
title: "Zachery Taylor, EI — Civil Designer in Pensacola, FL · Builder · Writer"
titleIsFull: true
description: "Zachery Taylor is a civil engineering designer and Engineer Intern (EI) in Pensacola, Florida — land development, grading, stormwater and utility design — plus mechanical engineering projects, a book in progress, and the story behind it all."
navKey: home
sheet: G-001
sheetTitle: "Cover sheet — the story so far"
scripts: ["/assets/js/quotes.js"]
---
{%- import "macros.njk" as ui with context -%}
{%- import "story-index.njk" as si with context -%}
{%- set featuredIds = ["surfboard", "baja", "cfd-wind-tunnel"] -%}

<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="hero-eyebrow"><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Pensacola, Florida · Engineer Intern (EI)</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title">Zachery <span class="name-last">Taylor</span></h1>
      <p class="positioning">Civil designer and Engineer Intern in Pensacola — I design <strong>site grading, stormwater, and utility plans</strong> for land development. I also build things, and I’m writing my first book.</p>
      <p class="motto">“Be a good human being, provide value to people.”</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/civil.html">See my civil work</a>
        <a class="btn" href="/book.html">About the book</a>
        <a class="btn" href="/resume.pdf">Résumé (PDF)</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="hero-panel" aria-label="About Zachery">
      {% include "partials/siteplan.njk" %}
      <div class="portrait-stack">
        <span class="tag" aria-hidden="true">ZT / DESIGNER · WRITER</span>
        <div class="portrait secondary">{% picture "images/G.jpg", "", "portrait", { loading: "eager", sizes: "104px" } %}</div>
        <div class="portrait primary">{% picture "images/H.jpg", "Portrait of Zachery Taylor", "portrait", { loading: "eager", fetchpriority: "high", sizes: "126px" } %}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-panel-content">
        <p class="small-label">ZT / 001 · SITE PLAN</p>
        <h2>Ideas become structure.</h2>
        <p>Writing, engineering, and long-term work built from the same foundation: clarity, discipline, and useful contribution.</p>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <ul class="proof-strip" aria-label="Credentials at a glance">
      <li><span class="k">Engineer Intern</span><span class="v">FE passed · <em>Dec 2025</em></span></li>
      <li><span class="k">Civil site design</span><span class="v">5+ years</span></li>
      <li><span class="k">UWF · 2026</span><span class="v">B.S. Mechanical Eng.</span></li>
      <li><span class="k">UWF · 2020</span><span class="v">B.S. Mathematics</span></li>
      <li><span class="k">Next milestone</span><span class="v">Civil PE exam · <em>Jan 2027</em></span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="quote-band" aria-labelledby="quote-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="visually-hidden" id="quote-title">From my quote bank</h2>
    <div class="quote-flashcard-wrap">
      <figure class="quote-flashcard" id="quote-flashcard" data-quote-id="{{ quotes.featured.id }}">
        <p class="kicker">From the quote bank · {{ quotes.count }} lines copied by hand</p>
        <blockquote class="quote-flashcard-text" id="quote-flashcard-text" tabindex="0" aria-label="Quote">“{{ quotes.featured.quote }}”</blockquote>
        <figcaption class="quote-flashcard-origin" id="quote-flashcard-origin">— {{ quotes.featured.origin }}</figcaption>
        <div class="quote-flashcard-footer">
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary btn-small" id="quote-flashcard-shuffle">Shuffle</button>
          <label class="switch"><input type="checkbox" id="quote-flashcard-fav-toggle"><span class="track" aria-hidden="true"></span>Favorites only</label>
          <a class="text-link" href="/personal.html#quotes">Browse all</a>
        </div>
      </figure>
      <p class="quote-empty" id="quote-flashcard-empty" role="status">No favorites to show yet — switch off “Favorites only” to see every quote.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" id="civil" aria-labelledby="civil-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    {{ ui.sectionLabel("C-101", "Civil work") }}
    <h2 id="civil-title">Land development, <em>drawn carefully.</em></h2>
    <p class="section-intro">{{ civil.summary }}</p>
    <ul class="sheet-grid">
      {%- for s in civil.scope %}
      <li class="sheet reveal">
        <h3>{{ s.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ s.text }}</p>
        <div class="tb" aria-hidden="true"><span>Scope</span><span>{{ s.code }}</span></div>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    <div class="cs-wrap">
      <div class="cs-head">
        <h3 class="cs-title">Civil projects</h3>
        <p>Each project gets its own page once it’s public and cleared to share.</p>
      </div>
      {%- set galleryQuick = false %}
      {% include "partials/civil-gallery.njk" %}
    </div>
    <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:28px">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/civil.html">Civil projects &amp; work history</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" id="projects" aria-labelledby="projects-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    {{ ui.sectionLabel("M-201", "Engineering projects") }}
    <h2 id="projects-title">Projects in progress <em>and practice.</em></h2>
    <p class="section-intro">Design, CFD, mechatronics, and statistics from my mechanical engineering and mathematics degrees — each with its own page, reports, and photos.</p>
    <ul class="project-grid">
      {%- for id in featuredIds %}{% for p in projects.academic %}{% if p.id == id %}
      {{ ui.projectCard(p, 3, false) }}
      {%- endif %}{% endfor %}{% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:28px">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/academic.html">All {{ projects.academic.length }} projects</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" id="book" aria-labelledby="book-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    {{ ui.sectionLabel("W-401", "The book") }}
    <h2 id="book-title">The book.</h2>
    <div class="book-feature reveal">
      <div>
        <p class="premise">Most of us optimize for credentials, comfort, and certainty. The truly scarce asset — and the most underpriced — is <em>vision, curiosity, and relationships.</em></p>
        <ul class="book-status" aria-label="Book status">
          <li class="done">Section I complete · July 2026</li>
          <li>Self-publishing · early 2027</li>
          <li>Title to be announced</li>
        </ul>
        {% set formId = "home" %}{% include "partials/newsletter.njk" %}
        <p style="margin-top:14px"><a class="text-link" href="/book.html">Why I’m writing it</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="book-cover" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="cover-label">WORK IN PROGRESS</span>
        <strong>Vision, curiosity &amp; relationships</strong>
        <small>By Zachery Taylor · ZT, LLC</small>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" id="story" aria-labelledby="story-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    {{ ui.sectionLabel("G-002", "The story so far") }}
    <h2 id="story-title">Ideas, rigor, <em>and the long game.</em></h2>
    <p class="section-intro">Mathematics, then mechanical engineering, a passed FE exam, five years at civil design firms, a first home, a marriage, and a book. The latest milestones are below, newest first. <a class="text-link" href="/now.html">What I’m doing now</a></p>
    <div class="story-grid">
      <div>
        {{ si.list(storyIndex.recent, { prefix: "home-" }) }}
        <p class="si-all"><a class="btn" href="/personal.html#story-index">The full story: all {{ storyIndex.entries.length }} milestones →</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="story-cards">
        <article class="card reveal">
          <div class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">01</div>
          <h3>Writing</h3>
          <p>The book is the long project: turning thought, experience, and ambition into something that can positively affect someone else.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card reveal">
          <div class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">02</div>
          <h3>Engineering path</h3>
          <p>The FE exam is passed and engineering school is complete. Now I’m gaining qualifying experience as an Engineer Intern and preparing for the Civil PE exam in January 2027.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card reveal">
          <div class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">03</div>
          <h3>ZT, LLC</h3>
          <p>A Pensacola-based single-member company that publishes the book and holds long-term projects and ventures.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" id="life" aria-labelledby="life-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    {{ ui.sectionLabel("L-301", "Life & interests") }}
    <h2 id="life-title">The rest <em>of the story.</em></h2>
    <p class="section-intro">Work is only part of it. There are the podcasts I’ve hosted with friends, a Best Ball archive going back to 2021, apps I built for my leagues, and a bank of quotes copied by hand from more than a hundred books.</p>
    {% include "partials/story-links.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    {{ ui.sectionLabel("G-003", "Contact") }}
    <h2 id="contact-title">Let’s talk.</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">Download the résumé, save my contact card, or send a note — I read everything.</p>
    <div class="contact-grid">
      {% include "partials/contact-form.njk" %}
      <div class="contact-side">
        <article class="biz-card">
          <p class="name">Zachery Taylor, EI</p>
          <p class="title">Civil Engineering Designer · Writer · ZT, LLC</p>
          <p class="line">Pensacola, Florida</p>
          <p class="line"><a href="mailto:{{ site.author.email }}">{{ site.author.email }}</a></p>
          <p class="line"><a href="tel:{{ site.author.phone }}">{{ site.author.phoneDisplay }}</a></p>
          <div class="actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/resume.pdf">Résumé (PDF)</a>
            <a class="btn" href="{{ site.author.linkedin }}" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
            <a class="btn" href="/contact.vcf" download>Save contact</a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
